 "note": "Frog Guy: a stumpy four-legged green frog built like Jeff the land shark (huge wide head that is most of him, round bean body, four short fat stumps on pale toe pads), a big dark grin with the tongue tip always blepping out, big glossy black eyes with white glints under heavy half-closed lids (right one droopier), pink blush, darker green spots, an orange scout sash full of merit badges slung round his middle. Astute, aloof and derpy. Egg-only, never spawns naturally.",
 "ability_desc": "Hop buddy: while he follows you (within 10 blocks) you get Jump Boost I (Jump Boost II from bond 3), and every so often he does a happy hop and a croak. A stumpy little frog on all fours, built like a land shark, in an orange scout sash full of merit badges. Astute, aloof and a total derp: chin in the air, heavy half-lidded eyes (one droopier than the other), the tip of his tongue always poking out of his grin. He waddles with a big side-to-side roll, turns his nose up at you, snaps flies out of the air, licks his own right eyeball like a gecko, tilts his head and stares, splats flat on his belly, croaks with his throat sac and naps in a splat. Not found in the wild: spawn him with his egg; he arrives already named Frog Guy and is tamed with a slimeball.",
